{#
  Base page shell.

  Deliberately empty of markup for now: this layout exists so pages can be
  migrated onto it one at a time without changing a single byte of their
  output. Shared <head>, nav and footer partials move in here next, and each
  page drops its copy as it adopts them.

  No trailing newline after the content tag — it would append a byte to every
  rendered page and break byte-for-byte comparison against the pre-migration
  output.
#}{{ content | safe }}